            <description><![CDATA[<p>Fixes extra Brave Browser windows appearing during a cold launch while Better Switch is running.</p>
<ul>
<li>Avoids reopening when Accessibility window information is unavailable or the app is still launching.</li>
<li>Rechecks visible windows before reopening.</li>
<li>Preserves minimized-window and Window-menu restoration.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
